# Grouped by primary license. The trailing comment is the full SPDX expression from
# Homebrew's formula metadata (casks carry no license field; those are from upstream).
# LICENSES.md is the full inventory, including what setup.sh installs outside this file.

### Permissive (MIT / BSD / Apache / ISC / Vim) ###
